# Teacher's Pet (windurst 28): 437 is a Progress line, which plays on what would be Moreno-Toeno's script's turn (his
# script answers a random 441 / 469 on every turn it gets). A level-1 WAR. 437 (Prog 1); Prog 0 again by GM: 437 again
# (an Event line would have given his script's 441 / 469 here); 438 finished with option 2 (not 0): Prog 0, not
# begun.
lists WindurstWaters/Moreno-Toeno/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/437 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/438
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=170.5,-1.25,156.9 job=WAR lvl=1
login
trigger Moreno-Toeno                          # Prog 0: 437 (walks beside him)
finish                                        # Prog 1
charvar Quest[2][28]Prog 0
trigger Moreno-Toeno                          # 437 again (a Progress line: the quest's turn on every talk)
finish                                        # Prog 1
trigger Moreno-Toeno                          # Prog 1: 438 (0, Bird Feather, Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud)
finish option=2                               # not 0: Prog 0 (not begun)
